            "value": "在窗口右键菜单里选“排布”：左半、右半、四角、居中、铺满屏幕、移到另一块屏幕。可以先看效果，移好之后还能撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.browser.axPerm.sub": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finds Dock icons and moves windows"
          }
