            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Buttons 4 and 5 become Back and Forward for the app in front. Needs Smooth scrolling or Mouse scroll direction on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "侧键 4、5 准备用作这个 App 的后退和前进。要和平滑滚动或鼠标滚动方向一起开。"
          }
